🟠 api in shop (prod-eu-1) cannot pull its image because registry registry.corp.example rejects the credentials. Its pods name no pull secret, so the registry sees anonymous pulls, and the registry answers "unauthorized: authentication required". Every error mentions it. Two failing workloads all depend on it. worker is affected as well. To see why the container cannot start, run kubectl describe pod api-64dc74af-c -n shop
🟠 api in shop (prod-eu-1) cannot pull its image because registry registry.corp.example rejects the credentials.
| 🟠 **api** in **shop** (**prod-eu-1**) cannot pull its image because registry **registry.corp.example** rejects the credentials.
| Its pods name no pull secret, so the registry sees anonymous pulls, and the registry answers `unauthorized: authentication required`.
| Every error mentions it.
| Two failing workloads all depend on it.
| **worker** is affected as well.
| To see why the container cannot start, run
| ```
| kubectl describe pod api-64dc74af-c -n shop
| ```
